      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُقَيْشٌ</span></b>  dim. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقْشٌ</span>, signifying The <i>pointing,</i> or
<i>dotting,</i> of characters and writing: (As, TA:) or
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْقَشُ</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُرَيْقِشُ</span></b>  [so in the TA, but in
some copies of the K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُرَيْقِشٌ</span>]: (AHát, K:) the
latter is allowable. (A Hát.)

